      <title>Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.5：AI打工仔变身“超级卷王”，一口气肝30小时代码？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/anthropic-claude-sonnet-45ai30-20250930174004801-0/</link>
